@PatchHarbor_Host = http://localhost:5000

GET {{PatchHarbor_Host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Submit a disclosure

POST {{PatchHarbor_Host}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Example issue",
  "description": "Explain the impact without including secrets.",
  "serverName": "Example Community",
  "severity": "High",
  "affectedComponent": "Moderation plugin",
  "affectedVersion": "1.0.0",
  "reproductionSteps": "Use a private channel for sensitive reproduction details.",
  "reporterContact": "security@example.org"
}

### List reports as a moderator

GET {{PatchHarbor_Host}}/api/reports
X-Admin-Key: {{$dotenv PATCHHARBOR_MODERATOR_KEY}}
Accept: application/json
